 see what tools can really make a difference in productivity!\"}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.done\",\"item_id\":\"rs_06bde40630abc07c016af1297d373c87d0b8f94ec053518b94\",\"output_index\":0,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Exploring productivity tools**\\n\\nI need to discover tools that can help with productivity. I want to focus on options like mail, calendar, drive, and various command tools. It’s important to evaluate what’s out there to find the best fit for tasks involving organization and efficiency. I'm looking forward to digging deeper into the choices available. Let's see what tools can really make a difference in productivity!\"},\"sequence_number\":78,\"summary_index\":0}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"rs_06bde40630abc07c016af1297d373c87d0b8f94ec053518b94\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8Sl_Iv5QzRC5QiLQkw1zzbD1Neywb73PY92UVqadF15Fl1uU_fJzdFuwby7QYr_7U79x8l-qon8aMRiAp8EaVmr9t2hrHvaYmo1CUL8DCm0wAlf-44LsajriTV98NwiPJxMmVjaxysuBXxDSmeCX9B53eb9enZNhwZ9KEXMSSgYl4SGZ5SHsDnc_tIG98oF-EJbhEhlRKI0siFHacRL4ktC4V2ZBJ5x3u6yAplEgE1wJ0gFLrF57cDZTd-iB_2hhvir4m1znv0pKhvQwRiewLiCK0SPi70UctBRuLpBI5uiB0E581lPrsLLaIqRULinbGdVgYinqpV97R3jG_mPOkk2MjrTQqmniFXZZKWyh6wXeSgjEanJ2R9VsUOVwW7W0zaanrPkAjGo9k-GWgwXNydpcToOQYTAvhRL-R2ylNhF1lZrOThJXZcMb4AoCA3S0g17k1z_kcA1V3rEecOR1cFXA3xaE-oIpB3Qs01-zF9GwK2-UPqrLrGjZgfrQ5K9oCfAb5rhY5bChXkyWR4aNJ2OTKOHaXskHrOo-wuZ7PxEm0FfRn4iJw0VRiZN0tD5KJPK-T1DSmZUUtnnyBxT20--JohtFrXQlBAy5sz4-MHyN7jcxf4H7YWWsHUpETiiQSbJiYh6SIzImmWpV8eN6m1hc1Y8ScYkInyVDyGdOV_cs1iJtsLdYCyAjKZJ3_xpeUYxgQELXVza9RQ6xEAKhdnBVlCmoRY3mqMBJ0JcYdV2WxYAKCMhNBtlOqgsWWJfqnFDZNPFAFG16wn59tR4hMF27xBz8ulX1TIDUZf0gktDi8r1eBNLc0BJcx9c66J4B3_8nGU5ACAuH9J8Ik_I7e-U2KoHfOwr3_6dFG7f49x-sAywJ_PqKRf6ZCiOuxEJFr7lCvYZisEuP7TAZTVTXO-8qCKDLz7gEazQoTFHQ0eAWWztmXf6LkKQ_eRZ4XGevIpuLjz6hJTlnM45u6jb5VYZxt7GbdsyYoa