XAWIZ9EF6SmAeR146l5LECU0icqmpGobEUM62_-MGeMZjrF05\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Determining date and timezone**\\n\\nI need to figure out tomorrow's date and timezone. The system doesn’t show the current date, so maybe I can infer it from the environment or user’s local settings. It could be helpful to search calendar options for flexible times. I also want to explore available tools to fetch the date and timezone. I might need a timestamp for accuracy, so I’ll look into my options for getting that information right now.\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_06bde40630abc07c016af12983e3bc87d0977984d9f7a15958\",\"call_id\":\"call_TBRC1Xf2XiRatpWOxkZ2VEXk\",\"name\":\"tool_search\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"get current date and user's timezone or profile settings\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_TBRC1Xf2XiRatpWOxkZ2VEXk\",\"output\":\"No matching tools found.\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"id\":\"rs_06bde40630abc07c016af1298565f487d09c137d58d8604c76\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8SmH1EueF1RRWBbwmCCBWgS7oztzlCTUrKBMR9Jna5v6_UYdFM4Cmt868Go7WkDuiUzsBTs0P8s7jrxKkCKeV0iHnFARYoHgKZzQN4hZoWK1x_6kR_7GCFT7246B_biconwSuDYoCunxJ5-q9YkiEl6qEodMmzOW6atwdqWzB8B0qKj4KrzuRLIK2oT0VMxClXosC-6pxlcQtOAR130mRAfcw3lv9gmXyYfI9d4YuAaudt8AajfjiQuUoozqRO6KBbpBXhz8_piLplRdd-Z6GI-6fuVdC4eUrFWpl3HELP3DA79dDnSJCRrbnRymCpkVRtwNgjIMkGioXu6DjR1bu6YNZKnx1mZq9xBG1sFs2z9T4-sYUFPFVzY5J7oqupapjt8ySmL9IkakG0QEw7Cmm9BuxONqIpjhWCRe1s8lcFP_QXoQTVu23Wcal6JubLAX0mi5B6UvI_r7sDMEbJrIesez57U1Lf-C0UWjHfXcdV8bi0r13RIAFYZpNXWMfr9Qrkwr16kVz3Kr5JtC9-xCVp06mwW0hzWFvhoWjG3wW1Haf7gUBrAPuLgMN-9OAwu6acUMCl39jtRV4Nkrh7H_Frl4Os64_m2qyWdC0bWxTBGwAktac6VQQcCrNrAIJu7MQWZn9Jklv56F94reWvTw_UWZfEAupWaMye9ajzgOnX1RGwZc5bnGdwFOG6QwVHG1vUTjHvviK4mg2AoWfsw741yA38uQY_vBY-UemBbNesnIc4IAVo59IOngh5EC4vDlkvKWbiS9xm8i1coTd4DznFiw7NrbwMV0RrpmyWwQxElJj0ZHGDECsaDE7f4ZYjbdnGUaOLrDCb1iyMvTe