rrect reply-to address. At the same time, I’ll look for the file through a web link available from the drive search. It would be efficient to check the email and the calendar simultaneously. A range from November 9 to November 12 should cover the necessary time zones, especially regarding any response events. I’ll use an explicit UTC query for clarity.\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_06bde40630abc07c016af12990828c87d09571b52467c57932\",\"call_id\":\"call_vmvBOnDn3KtK9H9icVARRLnP\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"thread\\\":\\\"thr_40fea6c373394c0e\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_06bde40630abc07c016af1299082a887d09db5ff5d3b17b51f\",\"call_id\":\"call_YbA1jEhiNheBX2gHo1DFPIyq\",\"name\":\"calendar\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"list\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"2026-11-09T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"to\\\":\\\"2026-11-12T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"limit\\\":100}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_06bde40630abc07c016af1299082b887d0b4a09f4fea6c3bfb\",\"call_id\":\"call_GNvr9brWBRvzfn6s7Q1kpdh2\",\"name\":\"drive\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"file\\\":\\\"file_140ecef09aa94a2a\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_vmvBOnDn3KtK9H9icVARRLnP\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_3f6f845241844a2f\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_40fea6c373394c0e\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"body\\\": {\\n        \\\"text\\\": \\\"Hi Sam,\\\\n\\\\nCan you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's planning review? Finance wants the Q3 travel line.\\\\n\\\\nThanks,\\\\nDana\\\",\\n        \\\"truncated\\\": false,\\n        \\\"limit_chars\\\": 20000\\n      },\\n      \\\"attachments\\\": []\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_YbA1jEhiNheBX2gHo1DFPIyq\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"events\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_bb4790c2734040fe\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Team standup\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:15:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"lee@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Lee Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": \\\"accepted\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_8a0b8b52f3e14334\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Q3 planning review\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T14:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T15:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Room 4\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": \\\"accepted\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_GNvr9brWBRvzfn6s7Q1kpdh2\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"file\\\": \\\"file_140ecef09aa94a2a\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Q3 Budget\\\",\\n  \\\"mime_type\\\": \\\"application/vnd.google-apps.spreadsheet\\\",\\n  \\\"modified_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-08T17:00:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"modified_by\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\",\\n  \\\"native_type\\\": \\\"spreadsheet\\\",\\n  \\\"web_url\\\": \\\"https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\",\\n  \\\"text\\\": {\\n    \\\"text\\\": \\\"line,q2,q3\\\\ntravel,12000,15500\\\\nsoftware,8000,8200\\\\nevents,4000,6500\\\",\\n    \\\"truncated\\\": false,\\n    \\\"limit_chars\\\": 100000\\n  },\\n  \\\"exported_as\\\": \\\"text/csv\\\"\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be0a-0382-74ee-a458-6516e6f73ef3\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
