put_text.delta\",\"content_index\":0,\"delta\":\"**\",\"item_id\":\"msg_06bde40630abc07c016af129963f5487d0ae0f832a085706b0\",\"logprobs\":[],\"obfuscation\":\"643DtUIc1MzKy7\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":134}\n\nevent: response.output_text.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_text.done\",\"content_index\":0,\"item_id\":\"msg_06bde40630abc07c016af129963f5487d0ae0f832a085706b0\",\"logprobs\":[],\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":135,\"text\":\"Tomorrow, **Tuesday, November 10** (calendar times are **UTC**):\\n\\n- **Team standup** — 9:00–9:15 AM\\n- **Q3 planning review** — 2:00–3:00 PM, Room 4\\n\\nYes, Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review; Finance wants to discuss the Q3 travel line. I found the [Q3 Budget spreadsheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget) and drafted a reply saying you’ll bring it. **The reply is saved as a draft and has not been sent.**\"}\n\nevent: response.content_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.content_part.done\",\"content_index\":0,\"item_id\":\"msg_06bde40630abc07c016af129963f5487d0ae0f832a085706b0\",\"output_index\":1,\"part\":{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"Tomorrow, **Tuesday, November 10** (calendar times are **UTC**):\\n\\n- **Team standup** — 9:00–9:15 AM\\n- **Q3 planning review** — 2:00–3:00 PM, Room 4\\n\\nYes, Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review; Finance wants to discuss the Q3 travel line. I found the [Q3 Budget spreadsheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget) and drafted a reply saying you’ll bring it. **The reply is saved as a draft and has not been sent.**\"},\"sequence_number\":136}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"msg_06bde40630abc07c016af129963f5487d0ae0f832a085706b0\",\"type\":\"message\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"Tomorrow, **Tuesday, November 10** (calendar times are **UTC**):\\n\\n- **Team standup** — 9:00–9:15 AM\\n- **Q3 planning review** — 2:00–3:00 PM, Room 4\\n\\nYes, Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review; Finance wants to discuss the Q3 travel line. I found the [Q3 Budget spreadsheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget) and drafted a reply saying you’ll bring it. **The reply is saved as a draft and has not been sent.**\"}],\"phase\":\"final_answer\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":137}\n\nevent: response.completed\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.completed\",\"response\":{\"id\":\"resp_06bde40630abc07c016af12993932c87d0867dc8b0b57800bc\",\"object\":\"response\",\"created_at\":1794189715,\"status\":\"completed\",\"access_programs\":null,\"background\":false,\"completed_at\":1794189718,\"error\":null,\"frequency_penalty\":0.0,\"image\":{\"context_compression\":\"disabled\"},\"incomplete_details\":null,\"instructions\":null,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"max_tool_calls\":null,\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"moderation\":null,\"output\":[{\"id\":\"rs_06bde40630abc07c016af1299453c487d0b132e120d1674a3b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8SmW0VfjOXNSkf2udutQsmrj2M6r5cebaNU6750hU2P56YPRi5tkeji99v-jJ4LGnGu29BZAHL0R3rx4a0rfhm5qUjDjt-lpa4RSK6U1FLoANgoGaCkCR-_ccFxdpkxMRZLuk3KUBWAPOenCBTCNxDByKptYhIRGXDXD_TH7tFqhRjG5_S1LxWGbcwttX-ckd2I0KwTvc4kGCQN5tQeGWxIH4cR2qjvrXlMXEHNHFrsuE3YjxUW1iraj5LTNcd6LZTP30OH6rPapMdWAwIdj6RLq9pd75Oab-nhO1mqjkL1DbaaIl3BMkWV6MJjwKYGD14k4CEJ8aEKczhwkBCoWzAPBaVhIssC1o3dyH2o0M7qgh6uZytOzHR8eMDTznYF_KnvJpszULy6FAalxjRczlpanYvEfR7JxG7ZyL5O0BGNytK7dnkc_9vmjYXAz88ySRsOKFEq--dufxjiOTPXCaNanZ20Jzn33r4FrJRKfzEkbStkgrKuDNQtRCKit4GMIdxPdj8N6TqmLDjfvvJvdQsvcQHl3aH3OZJB0QJVdIHAulDBloBXiK-fGRi9-ZVsVjySXIykTbCDqPrM1YrhtfDXEpDWZ5N2vSMgqSK-gB9ekzA1b0ghiO5k7vEHUyDAdhhDFf04kuM88eU8i_JWEAtcATA2MAwLo37A3MEvE34DSUfZy9P2x4pyr9xxXDC7S2q4z1-js9Hr9f-ctD